# BACKLOG R and #7: the focused window comes first.
#  - #7: Chrome focused on monitor 2 next to a fullscreen game drawing on
#    monitor 1 gets its WebGPU memory: the game gives what is needed, not
#    more (it was denied and the page died next to CoD).
#  - R3: the window focused before the current one keeps its memory against
#    the foreground's headroom (alt-tab back is instant); older ones go first.
#  - R5: when the focused game finds nothing else, a video drawing on the
#    other monitor gives what the game needs (the game wins), and only that.
cap 11000
proc 1614 kwin_wayland old
proc 1625 plasmashell old
proc 2589 chrome old chunk=16       # monitor 2
proc 9000 claude-desktop old chunk=16
proc 3877 spotify old chunk=16
proc 3000 mpv old chunk=16          # a video playing on monitor 2 all along
proc 5000 game chunk=64             # fullscreen on monitor 1

hint 1625 v
hint 2589 v
hint 9000 f
hint 3877 h
hint 3000 v
act 1614 0 4
act 1625 0 4
act 2589 60 0
act 9000 0 4
act 3877 600 0
act 3000 0 4
target 1614 280 0.75
target 1625 480 0.4
target 2589 600 0.7
target 9000 700 0.7
target 3877 400 0.8
target 3000 200 0.8
at 10

mark the user works in Claude, then starts the game (Claude is now the previous window)
hint 9000 h
act 9000 30 0
hint 5000 f full
act 5000 0 30
step
target 5000 4000 0.75 spread=10
at 20
target 5000 8400 0.75 spread=30
at 60
expect sys 5000 == 0
expect evicted 3877 > 0           # the hidden one focused never gave first
expect evicted 9000 == 0          # the previous window kept its memory
expect sys 2589 > 0               # Chrome (visible, idle) gave for the game

mark the user clicks Chrome on monitor 2: a WebGPU page needs 1.2 GB more, more than the others hold
hint 5000 v full
act 5000 0 30
hint 2589 f
act 2589 0 4
step
at 62
target 2589 1800 0.7 spread=4
at 70
expect denied 2589 == 0           # #7: no denial for the focused page
expect evicted 5000 > 0           # the game gave what the others did not have...
expect evicted 5000 <= 900        # ...and about only that
expect sys 2589 == 0

mark back to the game, which then streams in more than the idle ones hold
hint 2589 v
act 2589 30 0
hint 5000 f full
step
at 80
target 5000 9300 0.75 spread=20
at 110
expect sys 5000 == 0
expect denied 5000 == 0           # R5: the game got it, the video gave last
expect evicted 3000 > 0
